{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1", "title": "SONiC \u975e\u516c\u5f0f\u30c9\u30ad\u30e5\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8", "home_page_url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/", "feed_url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "SONiC NOS\uff08sonic-net/SONiC\uff09\u306e\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u975e\u516c\u5f0f\u30c9\u30ad\u30e5\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8", "icon": null, "authors": [], "language": "ja", "items": [{"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/", "title": "ACL & QoS", "content_html": "ACL & QoS \u2014 ACL\u3001CoPP\u3001mirror\u3001buffer\u3001PFC\u3001watermark\u3001scheduler \u306a\u3069\u30d1\u30b1\u30c3\u30c8\u5236\u5fa1\u3068 QoS \u3092\u6271\u3046\u7ae0\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T12:23:31+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/egress-mirroring-support-and-acl-action-capability-check/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/egress-mirroring-support-and-acl-action-capability-check/", "title": "ACL \u306e egress mirror \u5bfe\u5fdc\u3068 SAI \u30d9\u30fc\u30b9 action capability \u554f\u3044\u5408\u308f\u305b", "content_html": "ACL \u306e egress mirror \u5bfe\u5fdc\u3068 SAI \u30d9\u30fc\u30b9 action capability \u554f\u3044\u5408\u308f\u305b \u2014 ACL \u306f ASIC \u3054\u3068\u306b ingress / egress stage \u3067\u4f7f\u3048\u308b\u30a2\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u304c\u7570\u306a\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/egress-mirroring-support-and-acl-action-capability-check.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T15:45:11+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/sonic-qos-scheduler-and-shaping/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/sonic-qos-scheduler-and-shaping/", "title": "QoS Scheduler / Shaper\uff08SP / WRR / DWRR + min/max bandwidth\uff09", "content_html": "QoS Scheduler / Shaper\uff08SP / WRR / DWRR + min/max bandwidth\uff09 \u2014 SONiC \u306e QoS \u306b\u306f scheduling \u3068 shaping \u306e 2 \u8ef8\u304c\u3042\u308b:", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/sonic-qos-scheduler-and-shaping.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:46:32+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/wred-and-ecn-statistics/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/wred-and-ecn-statistics/", "title": "WRED / ECN \u7d71\u8a08\uff08per-queue / per-port\u3001capability \u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\uff09", "content_html": "WRED / ECN \u7d71\u8a08\uff08per-queue / per-port\u3001capability \u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\uff09 \u2014 SAI \u304c\u51fa\u3059 WRED \u30c9\u30ed\u30c3\u30d7 / ECN \u30de\u30fc\u30af\u5c02\u7528\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30bf\u3092 Flex Counter \u3067 COUNTERS_DB \u306b\u51fa\u3057\u3001show queue wredcounters \u304a\u3088\u3073 show interfa\u2026", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/wred-and-ecn-statistics.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T13:26:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/build-profiles/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/build-profiles/", "title": "\u30d3\u30eb\u30c9\u30d7\u30ed\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\uff08rules/profiles/*.mk\uff09", "content_html": "\u30d3\u30eb\u30c9\u30d7\u30ed\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\uff08rules/profiles/*.mk\uff09 \u2014 SONiC \u306e\u30d3\u30eb\u30c9\u306f\u591a\u6570\u306e\u30d3\u30eb\u30c9\u30d5\u30e9\u30b0\uff08ENABLE_ZTP, SECURE_UPGRADE_*, USERNAME, PASSWORD, CHANGE_DEFAULT_PASSWORD \u7b49\uff09\u306e\u7d44\u307f\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3067\u6319\u52d5\u304c\u5909\u308f\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/build-profiles.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T14:10:46+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/build-system-improvements/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/build-system-improvements/", "title": "\u30d3\u30eb\u30c9\u6642\u9593\u6700\u9069\u5316\uff08Dockerfile \u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u524a\u6e1b / BuildKit / \u4e26\u5217 dh / sairedis \u5206\u96e2\uff09", "content_html": "\u30d3\u30eb\u30c9\u6642\u9593\u6700\u9069\u5316\uff08Dockerfile \u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u524a\u6e1b / BuildKit / \u4e26\u5217 dh / sairedis \u5206\u96e2\uff09 \u2014 \u672c HLD \u306f\u4e3b\u306b\u7b2c 2 \u6bb5\u968e\u306b\u7126\u70b9\u3092\u5f53\u3066\u30014 \u3064\u306e\u6700\u9069\u5316\u3092\u63d0\u6848\u3059\u308b:", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/build-system-improvements.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T17:49:09+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design/", "title": "DIP=SIP PTF \u691c\u8a3c\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8", "content_html": "DIP=SIP PTF \u691c\u8a3c\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8 \u2014 \u300cDIP\uff08destination IP\uff09\u3068 SIP\uff08source IP\uff09\u304c\u540c\u3058\u300dL3 \u30d1\u30b1\u30c3\u30c8\u3092 SONiC \u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1\u304c\u6b63\u3057\u304f\u30eb\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0\u3067\u304d\u308b\u304b\u3092 PTF (Packet Test Framework) \u3067\u691c\u8a3c \u3059\u308b\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u306e\u8a2d\u8a08\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T14:15:04+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sonic-on-gns3-vm/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sonic-on-gns3-vm/", "title": "GNS3 VM \u4e0a\u3067\u306e SONiC \u52d5\u4f5c\uff08sonic-vs.img \u3068 Qemu \u30c6\u30f3\u30d7\u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\uff09", "content_html": "GNS3 VM \u4e0a\u3067\u306e SONiC \u52d5\u4f5c\uff08sonic-vs.img \u3068 Qemu \u30c6\u30f3\u30d7\u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\uff09 \u2014 GNS3 \u306f\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u6a5f\u5668\u3092\u30a8\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\u3057\u3066\u7c21\u6613\u30c8\u30dd\u30ed\u30b8\u3092 Windows \u4e0a\u307e\u305f\u306f Ubuntu \u30b5\u30fc\u30d0\u4e0a\u3067\u5b9f\u884c\u3067\u304d\u308b\u30c4\u30fc\u30eb\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/sonic-on-gns3-vm.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T17:50:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/steps-to-bring-up-sonic-vs/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/steps-to-bring-up-sonic-vs/", "title": "SONiC-VS \u306e\u30d3\u30eb\u30c9\u3068 libvirt \u8d77\u52d5\u624b\u9806", "content_html": "SONiC-VS \u306e\u30d3\u30eb\u30c9\u3068 libvirt \u8d77\u52d5\u624b\u9806 \u2014 SONiC-VS\uff08Virtual Switch\uff09\u306f ASIC \u3092 SAI VS \u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u30a8\u30f3\u30c9\u3067\u6a21\u3057\u305f\u4eee\u60f3\u30a4\u30e1\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u3001KVM/libvirt \u4e0a\u3067\u8d77\u52d5\u3057\u3066\u6a5f\u80fd\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u3084\u30c8\u30dd\u30ed\u30b8\u5b9f\u9a13\u306b\u4f7f\u3046\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/steps-to-bring-up-sonic-vs.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T17:52:29+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/evaluator/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/evaluator/", "title": "\u8a55\u4fa1\u8005\u5411\u3051\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9", "content_html": "\u8a55\u4fa1\u8005\u5411\u3051\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9 \u2014 \u30e9\u30dc\u3067 SONiC \u3092\u8a66\u7528\u3059\u308b\u8aad\u8005\u3092\u60f3\u5b9a\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4eee\u60f3\u74b0\u5883\u307e\u305f\u306f\u8a55\u4fa1\u6a5f\u3067\u8d77\u52d5\u3057\u3001\u7ba1\u7406 IP\u3001\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u3001VLAN\u3001BGP \u306a\u3069\u306e\u57fa\u672c\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u5165\u308c\u3001\u72b6\u614b\u78ba\u8a8d\u307e\u3067\u4e00\u9023\u306e\u6d41\u308c\u3092\u8fbf\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306e\u5c0e\u7dda\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/guides/evaluator.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:46:22+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/zmq-producer-consumer-state-table-design/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/zmq-producer-consumer-state-table-design/", "title": "ZMQ ProducerStateTable / ConsumerStateTable \u8a2d\u8a08", "content_html": "ZMQ ProducerStateTable / ConsumerStateTable \u8a2d\u8a08 \u2014 \u901a\u5e38\u306e ProducerStateTable / ConsumerStateTable \u306f Redis \u7d4c\u7531\u3067\u30e1\u30c3\u30bb\u30fc\u30b8\u3092\u904b\u3076\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/internals/zmq-producer-consumer-state-table-design.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T14:04:07+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/sonic-config-update-validation-via-yang/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/sonic-config-update-validation-via-yang/", "title": "YANG \u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u306b\u3088\u308b ConfigDB \u66f4\u65b0\u691c\u8a3c\uff08GCU + ConfigDBConnector \u30c7\u30b3\u30ec\u30fc\u30bf\uff09", "content_html": "YANG \u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u306b\u3088\u308b ConfigDB \u66f4\u65b0\u691c\u8a3c\uff08GCU + ConfigDBConnector \u30c7\u30b3\u30ec\u30fc\u30bf\uff09 \u2014 SONiC \u3067\u306f\u5f93\u6765\u3001config \u7cfb CLI \u304c ConfigDB \u306b\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u3080\u524d\u306e\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\u691c\u8a3c\u3092 Python \u306e\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9\uff08ad-hoc\uff09\u3068 YANG \u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u306e\u4e21\u65b9 \u3067\u91cd\u8907\u5b9a\u7fa9\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/sonic-config-update-validation-via-yang.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T17:30:10+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/subnet-decapsulation-with-sonic/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/subnet-decapsulation-with-sonic/", "title": "VLAN Subnet Decap\uff08Netscan \u7528 IPinIP MP2MP \u30c7\u30ab\u30d7\u30b9\u30eb\uff09", "content_html": "VLAN Subnet Decap\uff08Netscan \u7528 IPinIP MP2MP \u30c7\u30ab\u30d7\u30b9\u30eb\uff09 \u2014 Azure Netscan \u306f IPinIP \u30d7\u30ed\u30fc\u30d6\uff08outer DIP=\u30c7\u30d0\u30a4\u30b9 Loopback\u3001inner DIP=Netscan \u9001\u4fe1\u5143\uff09\u3067\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u7d4c\u8def\u306e blackhole \u3092\u691c\u77e5\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/platform/subnet-decapsulation-with-sonic.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T20:49:20+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "title": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary)", "content_html": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary) \u2014 SONiC NOS \u3067\u983b\u51fa\u3059\u308b\u56fa\u6709\u7528\u8a9e\u30fb\u7565\u8a9e\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u540d\u3092\u3001\u30a2\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30d9\u30c3\u30c8\u9806\u306b\u6574\u7406\u3057\u305f\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u306f\u300c\u7528\u8a9e / \u7565\u79f0 / \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8a33 / \u7c21\u6f54\u306a\u8aac\u660e / \u95a2\u9023\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u300d\u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3067\u8a18\u8f09\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:14:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/sai-attributes/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/sai-attributes/", "title": "\u983b\u51fa SAI \u5c5e\u6027\u65e9\u898b\u8868", "content_html": "\u983b\u51fa SAI \u5c5e\u6027\u65e9\u898b\u8868 \u2014 SONiC syncd \u306f SAI (Switch Abstraction Interface) \u3092\u4ecb\u3057\u3066 ASIC \u306b\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u6295\u5165\u3059\u308b\u3002\u672c\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u306f", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/sai-attributes.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:21:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/show-queue/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/show-queue/", "title": "show queue \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9", "content_html": "show queue \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9 \u2014 show queue \u306f queue counter\u3001WRED counter\u3001queue watermark \u3092\u8868\u793a\u3059\u308b CLI \u30b0\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7\u3002counter \u306f queuestat / wredstat\u3001watermark \u306f watermarkstat \u3078\u59d4\u8b72\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/show-queue.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:57:25+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/acl-table-type/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/acl-table-type/", "title": "ACL_TABLE_TYPE \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "ACL_TABLE_TYPE \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb \u2014 \u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u5b9a\u7fa9 ACL \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u30bf\u30a4\u30d7\uff08\u30ab\u30b9\u30bf\u30e0 match \u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9 / action / \u30d0\u30a4\u30f3\u30c9\u30dd\u30a4\u30f3\u30c8\uff09\u3092\u5b9a\u7fa9\u3059\u308b CONFIG_DB \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/acl-table-type.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-17T03:15:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/aclorch-state/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/aclorch-state/", "title": "ACL orchagent STATE_DB \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "STATE_DB \u306e ACL \u95a2\u9023\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb \u2014 AclOrch \u304c SAI ACL \u64cd\u4f5c\u5f8c\u306b\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u3080 ACL_TABLE_TABLE / ACL_RULE_TABLE / ACL_STAGE_CAPABILITY_TABLE \u306e\u69cb\u9020\u3068\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\u8a73\u7d30\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/aclorch-state.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-15T02:06:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/alarm-table/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/alarm-table/", "title": "ALARM \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb (EVENT_DB)", "content_html": "ALARM \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb \u2014 SONiC Event/Alarm Framework \u304c STATE_DB (EVENT_DB) \u306b\u4fdd\u6301\u3059\u308b\u30a2\u30af\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6\u30a2\u30e9\u30fc\u30e0\u4e00\u89a7\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3002eventd \u304c\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u307f\u3001gNMI/REST/CLI \u304c\u53c2\u7167\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/alarm-table.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-27T03:45:53+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-14T14:09:03+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/app-counter/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/app-counter/", "title": "\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u30b1\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3 \u30d5\u30ed\u30fc\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30bf\u8a2d\u5b9a", "content_html": "CONFIG_DB FLOW_COUNTER_ROUTE_PATTERN / FLEX_COUNTER_TABLE FLOW_CNT_TRAP|FLOW_CNT_ROUTE \u2014 route flow counter \u3068 trap flow counter \u306e\u6709\u52b9\u5316\u30fb\u30d1\u30bf\u30fc\u30f3\u8a2d\u5b9a\u30fb\u30dd\u30fc\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0\u9593\u9694\u306e\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9\u7531\u6765\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u89e3\u8aac\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.git